id: pm-csv-3044
title: Certify pm-csv with pm CLI and SDK 2026.9.28
description: "Update the exact development CLI pin and lockfile to the latest published 2026.9.28 toolchain, clear the extension host version skew, and certify the CSV package with its full release gate plus isolated packed npm and Bun acceptance. Companion fleet evidence: pm-cli-website-1o0w in the private companion tracker."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[3]: cli,release-readiness,sdk
created_at: "2026-09-28T15:34:43.752Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-02T23:23:11.118Z"
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: "Installed CLI 2026.9.28 passes pm health --strict-exit with no gate-failing findings; Exact-head npm run release:check passes with measured tests, coverage, docs, audit, pack, and changelog checks; Packed package works in isolated npm/Node and Bun workspaces"
actual_result: "npm ci and npm run release:check PASS: 235/235 tests, zero skipped, 100% measured lines/branches/functions across two loaded sources, 71 documented declarations. Packed npm-current, Bun-current and npm-minimum CSV import/export scenarios pass; strict CI health and pm validate pass; linked packaging tests pass 7/7; bun install --no-save passes. Updated only transitive brace-expansion 5.0.9 to 5.0.12 after red all-dependency audit; final audit has zero vulnerabilities. Exact PM pins unchanged. Independent statements and seven executable scripts remain outside the receipt in open pm-csv-rssj. History prefixes preserved; final-head CI/review remain separate, no closure or publication."
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-02T18:24:29.432Z",pi-land-a,"Merge-readiness verification pass by pi-land-a (fleet PR landing session): exact head 2612575 is up to date with origin/main (merge-base equals main tip), mergeable and CLEAN; Node 22/26, CodeQL, Greptile, Semgrep, DeepScan and Hound CI are green; both review threads are resolved; CodeRabbit's full review of this head completed with no new actionable findings (pm-csv#141 issuecomment-5874421212, check 'Review completed'). Sourcery budget exhausted (quota notice, not a review); Gemini not active. The whole-source statement coverage gap remains separately open under pm-csv-rssj."
  "2026-10-02T18:44:06.945Z",pi-land-a,"Cubic review (new head 5723475) found the README still stated the development and release gates are pinned to pm CLI/SDK 2026.8.21 while package.json pins 2026.9.28. Fixed test-first: test/packaging.test.ts now asserts the README's stated gate version equals the exact dev pin (the new test failed before the README correction), README states 2026.9.28, and the full npm run release:check passed 235/235 tests with the coverage gate met, zero production audit findings, and changelog:check clean. The item intentionally remains in_progress: per the landing workflow the orchestrator closes certification items after merge, so it is not closed in this PR."
  "2026-10-02T22:57:49.872Z",codex-sol,"Restart codex-sol: retained pushed head 381e7e7, existing README-pin fix and all four resolved threads preserved. Rebase current main, rerun full release:check/strict CI health/Bun install. Current-state evidence will report actual test totals and measured scope; whole-source/statement gap remains pm-csv-rssj. No item closure or publication."
  "2026-10-02T23:09:27.536Z",codex-sol,"All-dependency npm audit reproduced one high development-only brace-expansion advisory at installed 5.0.9 via minimatch/ESLint. No matching tracker item. After the current serialized release gate completes, update only that allowed transitive range to a fixed patch and rerun npm ci plus release:check/Bun/audit. Exact PM tool pins remain unchanged. Linked packaging tests and strict CI health/validate pass."
  "2026-10-02T23:23:10.632Z",codex-sol,"npm ci and npm run release:check PASS: 235/235 tests, zero skipped, 100% measured lines/branches/functions across two loaded sources, 71 documented declarations. Packed npm-current, Bun-current and npm-minimum CSV import/export scenarios pass; strict CI health and pm validate pass; linked packaging tests pass 7/7; bun install --no-save passes. Updated only transitive brace-expansion 5.0.9 to 5.0.12 after red all-dependency audit; final audit has zero vulnerabilities. Exact PM pins unchanged. Independent statements and seven executable scripts remain outside the receipt in open pm-csv-rssj. History prefixes preserved; final-head CI/review remain separate, no closure or publication."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-28T15:38:19.824Z",codex,"CLI 2026.9.28 clears extension host skew; strict health passes with one stale-item advisory. Exact-head npm run release:check passed: 234/234 tests, zero skips, 100% lines/branches/functions over 2 measured sources, 71/71 docstrings over 9 files, zero production audit findings, changelog/attestation/date checks, packed npm-current/Bun-current/npm-minimum CSV create-import-export receipts. Whole-source and statement coverage remain open in pm-csv-rssj."
